396 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (The Q1 2025 State of API Security Report paints a vivid picture of progress and ongoing API security challenges. API adoption has become a cornerstone of digital transformation, with rapid growth driven by cloud migration, integration efforts, and the monetization of data and functionality. This expansion, however, has created complex ecosystems that often outpace the security measures in place.)
/E (The Q1 2025 State of API Security Report paints a vivid picture of progress and ongoing API security challenges. API adoption has become a cornerstone of digital transformation, with rapid growth driven by cloud migration, integration efforts, and the monetization of data and functionality. This expansion, however, has created complex ecosystems that often outpace the security measures in place.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [2 3 4 5 6]
>>
endobj
