2657 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (Conclusion and Recommendations)
/E (Conclusion and Recommendations)
/Alt ()
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
2658 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The Q1 2025 State of API Security Report offers essential insights into the challenges and priorities in API development and security, and gives insight into how organizations are adjusting their strategies in response to the evolving landscape. Based on responses from over 200 professionals responsible for APIs in their organizations, the report demonstrates the growing reliance on APIs for digital transformation, the escalating pace of API adoption, and the persistent security challenges that organizations face. Even with heightened investment in API security, significant gaps persist, especially in runtime security, real-time monitoring, and the specific risks posed by emerging technologies, such as GenAI.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
2659 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (While the API security landscape shows signs of maturity, organizations must accelerate their efforts to close critical gaps. Real-time monitoring, enhanced runtime protection, alignment with recognized frameworks, and investments in advanced tools and training are imperative to safeguard APIs in an increasingly digital and interconnected world. By addressing these areas, organizations can turn API security from a reactive effort into a proactive enabler of innovation and growth.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
2660 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E <>
/Alt ()
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
2661 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Some recommendations based on the findings of this report include:)
/Alt ()
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
2662 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Prioritize Real-Time Monitoring and Runtime Security)
/Alt ()
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
2663 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The report highlights significant gaps in real-time API monitoring, with only 20% of organizations continuously monitoring APIs. Prioritizing real-time monitoring tools and practices is essential to enable immediate threat detection and response, minimizing the potential damage caused by attackers.Investments in advanced runtime security solutions are also critical to address vulnerabilities during production.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
2664 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Develop Comprehensive API Security Strategies and Frameworks)
/Alt ()
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
2665 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (With 60% of organizations still in the planning or basic stages of their API security strategies, it is essential to promote the adoption of comprehensive and advanced approaches. Aligning security practices with recognized frameworks like the OWASP API Security Top Ten and implementing robust governance policies are vital steps to ensure consistent and effective API security across the organization.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
